OL,3,AQueen reflects on reading 'forbidden'
OL,4,ALady Chatterley's Lover under the
OL,5,Apillow
OL,6,
OL,7,FQueen Camilla has recalled secretly
OL,8,Freading Lady Chatterley's Lover, the
OL,9,Fpassionate and controversial novel by
OL,10,FDH Lawrence, as a teenager in the
OL,11,F1960s.
OL,13,F"As teenagers you read a lot of
OL,14,Fromances. It was the moment of Lady
OL,15,FChatterley, under our pillows, reading
OL,16,Fthat by torchlight. You know the minute
OL,17,Fsomething is forbidden, you want to get
OL,18,Fhold of it," she said about the novel
OL,19,Fthat had been at the centre of an
OL,20,Fobscenity trial.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
