OL,3,AQueen reflects on reading 'forbidden'
OL,4,ALady Chatterley's Lover under the
OL,5,Apillow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Queen spoke about memorable moments
OL,8,Fin her own reading for BBC documentary
OL,9,FThe Book That Changed My Life, and
OL,10,Fabout the life-changing power of
OL,11,Fliteracy and books.
OL,13,FShe gave a glimpse of how regular
OL,14,Freading is part of her royal marriage:
OL,15,F"It's like the best tonic in the world.
OL,16,FMy husband and I actually read before
OL,17,Fdinner, just sitting quietly and
OL,18,Freading.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
